   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2023-09-05",
   "text": "Nationwide Right To Unionize Act\n This bill authorizes labor agreements to require membership in a labor organization (i.e., union) as a condition of employment regardless of state law (thus preempting any state laws that prohibit such agreements)."
